{
  "$schema": "./_schema.json",
  "$comment": [
    "sherpa-onnx STT models for the CPU tier (speech::engines::sherpa_online / sherpa_offline), owned by P2-B. How each id runs (files, family, languages, capabilities) is speech_rt::sherpa::catalog; a unit test keeps that table and this fragment in step.",
    "Archives are official k2-fsa 'asr-models' release assets (sha256 = GitHub asset digests, re-checked by downloading them through the model store on 2026-09-29); only the int8 model files, tokens and notices are extracted (strip 1, include).",
    "Nemotron 3.5 streaming: 560 ms chunks are the default (RTF 0.30-0.35 on one thread of a 7800X3D, fewer errors); 160 ms chunks give earlier partials at RTF 0.80-0.87. Always given an explicit language (per-stream 'language' option).",
    "SenseVoice: the 2024-07-17 package is the original FunAudioLLM SenseVoiceSmall; the 2025-09-09 package is a Cantonese (WSYue) fine-tune and is not listed (ADR 0002).",
    "Parakeet Ultra: community sherpa-onnx int8 export of moondream/parakeet-ultra (HF mldecode/parakeet-ultra-onnx-int8, pinned commit 3282a6e3; credit NVIDIA and Moondream). Sigil checked it against Parakeet TDT v3 int8 (2026-09-29, en/de/es/fr/ru clips: identical transcripts on four, one word better and one word worse on es; same encoder metadata and speed, RTF 0.065 at 2 threads); third-party FLEURS / LibriSpeech results favour Ultra.",
    "Language ID: the multilingual Whisper base int8 encoder / decoder from HF csukuangfj/sherpa-onnx-whisper-base (pinned commit bb53ee20).",
    "Update: pin new assets with scripts/models/pin-catalog.mjs and update speech_rt/sherpa/catalog.rs in the same change."
  ],
